<title>USA: Candlewood Hotel breaks ground on hotel.</title>
<headline>Candlewood Hotel breaks ground on hotel.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candlewood Hotel Co Inc said Tuesday it began construction of a 78-suite hotel in the Wichita area.</p>
<p>Candlewood said the new hotel will be its second in the region and its 13th nationwide.</p>
<p>Other details about the project were not available.</p>
<p>The company develops hotel properties tailored for the business traveler.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
